    "> If you need the old docs - v3.x.x and under - you can find it [here](https://github.com/animate-css/animate.css/tree/a8d92e585b1b302f7749809c3308d5e381f9cb17).\n",
    "## Just-add-water CSS animation\n",
    "## Installation\n",
